    "body": "Add a vector that would have caught https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36076.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, #2075 clarified that  `Combine` is _not_ commutative, however the actual test vectors are. The first commit clarifies that the existing test vectors should be run in both orders, while leaving room for exceptions if we ever need to standardize conflict resolution.",
